8. Unique Idea of LegalEase

The main idea that differentiates LegalEase is its focus on making document drafting simple and guided.

Instead of:

> "Write your legal document yourself."



LegalEase follows:

> "Tell us what you need → Answer simple questions → Review the generated draft."



This reduces the complexity of traditional document preparation.


---

9. Safety and Legal Considerations

Because LegalEase deals with legal documents, the brainstorming phase should also consider responsible use.

The system should:

Clearly state that generated documents are drafts.

Encourage users to verify important information.

Avoid claiming that the AI provides professional legal representation.

Recommend consultation with a qualified lawyer for complex or high-risk matters.

Avoid fabricating laws, regulations, citations, or facts.

Protect user-provided personal information.

Include appropriate privacy and security measures.



