14. Final Brainstorming Outcome

After analyzing the problems and possible solutions, the team finalized the idea of LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator.

The proposed system will provide a simple platform where users can:

Select a document → Enter basic details → Generate an AI-assisted draft → Review/Edit → Download.

The brainstorming phase establishes the project's purpose, target users, major features, technology possibilities, and safety considerations, providing the foundation for the next phases: Requirement Analysis, Design, Planning, Development, Testing, Documentation, and Demonstration.
